  "notes": "Real 3-storey cream house, close street view. Warm cream render (#e0d3b3). Tall windows behind BROWN wooden louvred shutters (#a06e3f) plus blue-glass windows with white surrounds (#e8ddc0); a white fabric awning over the mid window. Top storey right corner clad with brown horizontal wood slats (band). Flat roof with a thin orange fascia line. Left side has a glazed sunroom/veranda. White picket boundary fence over a low render base, palm tree, mailbox, green + grey bins on the brick-paver sidewalk. Colours sampled from ref 2026-07-04. Environment 2026-07-05: tall palm at left, long ivy-draped hedge over the picket fence, tall cypress plus two round oak trees at right, wooden planter pots and grass tufts, green + grey bins by the left gate."
